<Base title="How to Resize Photo to 20 KB for Online Form | Photo 20 KB Kaise Kare — FormFix India" description="How to resize a photo to 20 KB for an online form, step by step on your phone: choose the 20 KB tool, preview, check actual bytes, and what to do if the photo becomes blurry.">
